== Generator and table (2026-11-06) ==
scripts/generate_population_context.py reads reports/sas_frequencies.json (pooled and per-cohort phenotype counts,
n_reports), reports/sas_deviation_filtered.json (input_artifacts: positions present and required) and the measurement
date from reports/sas_cohort_expansion.md. It writes app/lib/generated/population_context.g.dart, one JSON string the
client parses; --check exits 1 if the committed file differs. Reduced function is Poor plus Intermediate Metabolizer,
for SLCO1B1 Poor plus Decreased Function. Indeterminate, No Result and n/a stay in the denominator. 95% Wilson,
z 1.96. No figure is typed in the generator.

Read back from the generated table (measured 2026-08-14, n 601, cohorts PJL BEB STU ITU GIH):
  CYP2C19 343/601 57.1 [53.1, 61.0]  positions 16/35  No Result 1, n/a 15 in the total
  CYP2C9  175/601 29.1 [25.6, 32.9]  positions 17/88  Indeterminate 4, No Result 1
  SLCO1B1  46/601  7.7 [5.8, 10.1]   positions 20/35  No Result 9, n/a 37
  TPMT     20/601  3.3 [2.2, 5.1]    positions 9/45
  NUDT15   78/601 13.0 [10.5, 15.9]  positions 5/20
  DPYD     13/601  2.2 [1.3, 3.7]    positions not measured, Indeterminate 129
  CYP2C19 cohorts: PJL 79/146 54.1 [46.0, 62.0]; BEB 75/131 57.3 [48.7, 65.4]; STU 73/114 64.0 [54.9, 72.3];
  ITU 65/107 60.7 [51.3, 69.5]; GIH 51/103 49.5 [40.1, 59.0]. These are the report's own documented figures.

== Client ==
lib/models/population_context.dart  parses the table; southAsianContextFor(gene) returns null for CYP2D6 and any gene
not measured. Percent and interval are displayed as the generator wrote them, never recomputed.
lib/widgets/population_context_panel.dart  the row title is "South Asian context - not used for this result". The
panel gives the pooled headline ("At least P% (95% CI L-H%) of 601 people in five South Asian 1000 Genomes cohorts
were called <reduced> for <gene>."), the five cohort lines with n, then the caveats: context only, nothing here was
used to reach the result; a lower bound, with positions present out of required (DPYD: not measured) and the reason;
the Indeterminate or no-result count, in the total and not as reduced; PharmCAT's calls on research-format data this
application would itself decline; four of the five cohorts collected outside India; a frequency is not an outcome;
the measurement date and its report. With no figure: "No South Asian figure was measured for <gene>, so none is
shown.", or for a drug with no gene assessed, the no-gene sentence. No number is shown in either case.
lib/widgets/verdict_card.dart  one DisclosureRow, last in both the patient and clinician bodies, closed by default.
No other client file changed. No backend/app file changed.
scripts/scientific_hash_policy.json  the three new served files added to core_paths (102 -> 105), sorted, no
duplicates: app/lib/generated/population_context.g.dart, app/lib/models/population_context.dart,
app/lib/widgets/population_context_panel.dart.

