"Leave it as is". The South Asian context row stays keyed on each drug's primary gene, as AC4 requires, so
azathioprine's card shows TPMT's measured figure (3.3%) and not NUDT15's (13.0%). AC4 is not amended. The finding
above stays recorded so the choice remains visible; nothing about it is pending.
